{
  "doc": "Story 549. Every shepherd-vet marker comment on a haynes-ops PR, read 2026-11-12 over REST (GET repos/thaynes43/haynes-ops/issues/<pr>/comments, from the 63 PRs GitHub search lists with shepherd-vet in a comment). 64 are by the haynes-ops-bot app (user.login haynes-ops-bot[bot], type Bot, id 298460192, performed_via_github_app haynes-ops-bot) and each starts with <!-- shepherd-vet sha=<40 hex> --> then a VERDICT line; GraphQL (gh pr view --json comments) reports the same author as haynes-ops-bot, a user name GitHub answers 404 for, so anyone could register it. The 65th marker on record (PR 4827, github-actions[bot]) is a Flux diff that quotes a marker in a file; it is left out. body keeps the first two non-empty lines only. shepherd-prefilter-selftest.sh checks that the pre-filter counts each of the 64 for its own head and counts forged copies of them for none.",
